| 🔴 Critical | 2 | Underscore 4-alloc chain; Pascalize ~5 allocs/word |
| 🟡 Moderate | 5 | Missing GeneratedRegex, compiled regex per instance, double eval, culture bug, Camelize extra alloc |
| ℹ️ Info | 1 | Unsealed class |

